    "northStar": "The existing reseller service page",
    "overview": "This is a scoped record of the shipped public reseller template, its Sales tools content editor, and inquiry delivery details. It preserves the incumbent light surfaces, dark text, system typography and reseller accent. It does not establish a new identity or describe a dashboard redesign.",
